// Numbers the enchanted jewellery in general/scripts/enchanted_jewellry/ runs on.

// The Ring of recoil shatters once it has recoiled this much damage. Read twice by
// ring_of_recoil.rs2 - once to spend it, once for Check to count down from it - which is why it
// stopped being a bare 40 written in one place.
^ring_of_recoil_charges = 40
